ck;margin:0 auto;max-height:40vh;vertical-align:baseline\" alt=\"IIT-JEE 2011 Paper 2 Offline Chemistry - Biomolecules Question 13 English Explanation 2\" srcset=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/500/image/jaoe38c1m3coql7v/b3bce898-cec4-4fe1-8b0b-b1013de912a6/340e6bb0-9ffc-11ef-8de7-75b6f1ed123a/file-jaoe38c1m3coql7w.png?format=png 500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/750/image/jaoe38c1m3coql7v/b3bce898-cec4-4fe1-8b0b-b1013de912a6/340e6bb0-9ffc-11ef-8de7-75b6f1ed123a/file-jaoe38c1m3coql7w.png?format=png 750w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/jaoe38c1m3coql7v/b3bce898-cec4-4fe1-8b0b-b1013de912a6/340e6bb0-9ffc-11ef-8de7-75b6f1ed123a/file-jaoe38c1m3coql7w.png?format=png 1000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1500/image/jaoe38c1m3coql7v/b3bce898-cec4-4fe1-8b0b-b1013de912a6/340e6bb0-9ffc-11ef-8de7-75b6f1ed123a/file-jaoe38c1m3coql7w.png?format=png 1500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2000/image/jaoe38c1m3coql7v/b3bce898-cec4-4fe1-8b0b-b1013de912a6/340e6bb0-9ffc-11ef-8de7-75b6f1ed123a/file-jaoe38c1m3coql7w.png?format=png 2000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2500/image/jaoe38c1m3coql7v/b3bce898-cec4-4fe1-8b0b-b1013de912a6/340e6bb0-9ffc-11ef-8de7-75b6f1ed123a/file-jaoe38c1m3coql7w.png?format=png 2500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 720px\" decoding=\"async\"></p>\n<p>The fischer form of pyranose ring has groups above the ring on left and groups below the ring on right.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/jaoe38c1m3coqi4e/658280fb-7f07-42e3-9db0-d08cd248de8f/31aa15e0-9ffc-11ef-8de7-75b6f1ed123a/file-jaoe38c1m3coqi4f.png?format=png\" data-orsrc=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/jaoe38c1m3coqi4e/658280fb-7f07-42e3-9db0-d08cd248de8f/31aa15e0-9ffc-11ef-8de7-75b6f1ed123a/file-jaoe38c1m3coqi4f.png\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;max-height:40vh;vertical-align:baseline\" alt=\"IIT-JEE 2011 Paper 2 Offline Chemistry 